# APERTURE Holiday PostHog — example deployment variables (no real values).
# In GitHub repository settings > Secrets and variables > Actions:
#   Secret POSTHOG_PROJECT_TOKEN = the PUBLIC project token shown in PostHog project settings.
#   Variable POSTHOG_API_HOST = your project's exact ingestion region host.
# GitHub Actions writes these values into the PUBLISHED analytics config during deployment.
# Never use a PostHog personal API key; do not commit real values.
POSTHOG_PROJECT_TOKEN=
POSTHOG_API_HOST=
